00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:56.070
launch some of the social
features, including the friends

00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:59.310
and creating features
for Pokemon, the ability

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:00.840
to send GIFs, and
also the weather

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:07.230
features that help with respond
