00:02:19.962 --> 00:02:21.920
I'm going to be a little
bit vague about scale,

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:25.250
but I will say that we do have
a large number of players.

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:28.610
We have players that want
to play the game 24/7.

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:31.010
They want the game to work
whenever and wherever they

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:32.740
decide to play.

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:34.390
We run on the Google
Cloud platform

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:37.360
and make heavy use of the
Kubernetes engine, Spanner,

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:42.190
Data Flow, Cloud Load Balancer,
and several other GCP services.

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:45.140
Our architecture is
