00:02:56.960 --> 00:03:00.410
like keeping track of the
game state, player activity,

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:02.450
keeping track of game rules.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:04.280
The back-end services
take care of things

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:08.090
such as supporting our spatial
